    {
        "ticket_id": "ticket_15",
        "channel_id": "1328164015117176925",
        "user_id": "159170418396102656",
        "user_nickname": "[ IX ] Tru",
        "issue_type": "Question about MOD's",
        "details": "Are we allowed to run whatever planet we want during the MOD? Rohgahr claimed we could, and wanted to clarify the rules on this.",
        "tag": "General Issue",
        "created_at": "2025-01-13T00:49:32.297Z",
        "messages": [
            {
                "user_id": "236292964052107264",
                "user_nickname": "[ XIII ] HoeenHero",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T00:50:14.113Z",
                "content": "Leaving this for <@245323793000693765>"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "159170418396102656",
                "user_nickname": "[ IX ] Tru",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T02:24:11.502Z",
                "content": "Just curious, since there's been a few times I miss a MOD simply because I didn't want to play the planet that was ordered. Not trying to get him in trouble."
            },
            {
                "user_id": "245323793000693765",
                "user_nickname": "[ XL ] Philosophical_Bread",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T02:33:00.669Z",
                "content": "<@159170418396102656> There is not any rule against it as a matter of fact. Common misconception, our MOD is oriented around the MOD, although you can deploy elsewhere. Just know we may not record your planet"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "245323793000693765",
                "user_nickname": "[ XL ] Philosophical_Bread",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T02:33:22.724Z",
                "content": "as we typically state the intended planet"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "159170418396102656",
                "user_nickname": "[ IX ] Tru",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T02:35:18.460Z",
                "content": "Ah, gotcha. So you'd still get Iron?"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "245323793000693765",
                "user_nickname": "[ XL ] Philosophical_Bread",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T02:59:34.719Z",
                "content": "<@159170418396102656> If the bot counts your time, yeah"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "245323793000693765",
                "user_nickname": "[ XL ] Philosophical_Bread",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T02:59:59.597Z",
                "content": "Which is 1 hour and 30 minutes uninterrupted in an SES channel"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "236292964052107264",
                "user_nickname": "[ XIII ] HoeenHero",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T03:44:54.831Z",
                "content": "it can be interrupted, as long as its 1 hour 30 minutes"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "245323793000693765",
                "user_nickname": "[ XL ] Philosophical_Bread",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T03:45:36.382Z",
                "content": "Oh seriously? That's something I didn't know"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "236292964052107264",
                "user_nickname": "[ XIII ] HoeenHero",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T03:46:02.790Z",
                "content": "ive told you this before u.u"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "159170418396102656",
                "user_nickname": "[ IX ] Tru",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T11:18:56.735Z",
                "content": "Makes sense, since connection issues can show up occasionally, to reduce paperwork. Thank you both for answering."
            }
        ],
        "closed": true,
        "closing_details": {
            "closed_at": "2025-01-13T11:19:54.534Z",
            "closed_by": {
                "user_id": "159170418396102656",
                "user_nickname": "[ IX ] Tru"
            },
            "resolved": "Yes",
            "summary": "Requesting clarification on MOD rules around doing other planets outside of host requested planets. The answer was yes."
        },
        "closed_at": "2025-01-13T11:19:54.534Z"
    },
