    {
        "ticket_id": "ticket_18",
        "channel_id": "1328445124019224617",
        "user_id": "224661753798197248",
        "user_nickname": "[ 0 ] BombDon",
        "issue_type": "I’m new and would like guidance on how to engage with everyone",
        "details": "How should I interact with everyone and how do I get to know everyone. Also I’m new to gaming with people via discord, although I’m not new to gaming and would like to know what is the typical etiquette here on the 1st in terms of how the major order deployments work and how do people get to interact with the moderators and more established members. Etc",
        "tag": "General Issue",
        "created_at": "2025-01-13T19:26:33.367Z",
        "messages": [
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:27:46.834Z",
                "content": "Hello BombDon"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:28:26.168Z",
                "content": "a good way to start is joining one of the ships and asking if they need any help"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "224661753798197248",
                "user_nickname": "[ 0 ] BombDon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:28:26.453Z",
                "content": "hi"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:29:03.321Z",
                "content": "that way you can talk to the members in a common ground, that is the cooperation of doing some dives"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:29:49.822Z",
                "content": "if you see people in one of the Lounge chanels you can join as well, members of the 1st CR are very friendly and open to conversations"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:31:19.231Z",
                "content": "especily with the new members, there is no etiquette per say, just remember to be niceto everyone, usualy if you see a ship that has 4 people allready they are most likely full"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:31:55.116Z",
                "content": "you can also make your own ship nd invite 3 more divers in the Looking-for-group chat"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:32:23.803Z",
                "content": "remember to use the @(ON-CALL) wihtout the prentecis so people see your message"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "224661753798197248",
                "user_nickname": "[ 0 ] BombDon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:32:33.777Z",
                "content": "when you say ship you mean the voice channels for SES? or do you mean going on lfg and joining someone?"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "224661753798197248",
                "user_nickname": "[ 0 ] BombDon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:32:46.020Z",
                "content": "o ok so both"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:33:02.960Z",
                "content": "yes the ships are the SES"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:33:44.894Z",
                "content": "you cn go on the create-ship-vc chanel and use the bot to create your on VC"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:34:05.794Z",
                "content": "and then go to the looking-for-group to find more players"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:34:31.129Z",
                "content": "or if you just wanna talk or share something you can join one of the Lounge chanels"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "224661753798197248",
                "user_nickname": "[ 0 ] BombDon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:35:21.011Z",
                "content": "and in the major deployments if for example i sign up for wednesday how do i get strapped in and put in a squad? How does one usually go about that?"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:35:49.617Z",
                "content": "at the start of the MOD you will see that everione is in DIspatch VC"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:36:09.098Z",
                "content": "join there, and some players will create the VC"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "206628307914063874",
                "user_nickname": "[ XVII ] Toshi",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:36:17.990Z",
                "content": "I will also add we have a role you can ping if you want to look for people to join your squad the ONCALL role you can give yourself this role in <#1244035446439280711> if you wish."
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:37:17.631Z",
                "content": "then you go to any that are not full, right now the Iron COmmsion is working on a bot that will outo deploy yuo to a ship that need another squad member, but I dont know when that will come out"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "224661753798197248",
                "user_nickname": "[ 0 ] BombDon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:37:45.257Z",
                "content": "ok"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "206628307914063874",
                "user_nickname": "[ XVII ] Toshi",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:38:39.677Z",
                "content": "If you sign up for a MOD you will be pinged 15 mins before you will just join Dispatch VC and the Freedom Captain hosting the MOD will get organize everyone into ship VCs"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "224661753798197248",
                "user_nickname": "[ 0 ] BombDon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:39:19.829Z",
                "content": "Thank you guys"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "900818089988485181",
                "user_nickname": "[ XV ] Lee Lemon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:39:55.148Z",
                "content": "No problem, if you have more questions we will be happy to help you out"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "224661753798197248",
                "user_nickname": "[ 0 ] BombDon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:40:01.197Z",
                "content": "i hope to see yall on a deployment"
            },
            {
                "user_id": "224661753798197248",
                "user_nickname": "[ 0 ] BombDon",
                "timestamp": "2025-01-13T19:40:07.975Z",
                "content": "thanks"
            }
        ],
        "closed": true,
